Z||000001||stimpy||08-24-2000||10:31 PM||||Here at the Fiero Forum we are always happy to help out newbies.   Posting smilies is a simple process. To post them, you first need to open a "smiley account" by sending a check for $500   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> to J. Stillwell, POB 6686 Oklahoma City OK 73137.  We will then send you a list of top- secret codes used to enter the smiley.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> We will then monitor your use of smilies, at the very reasonable rate of 14.27 per smiley.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"> Once you have used up the deposit, we will invoice monthly, net due upon receipt.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> Just another service from the great folks at the Fiero Forum!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Or you could look to the left of the message you are posting while posting it and click on the "smilies legend".  But that would be too easy.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif">  <BR><p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 08-24-2000).]||||reg||1
